# PR review replies

External reviewers and Qwen/local-LLM are advisory, but their substantive
feedback is not optional. Reply in-thread with `Implemented`, `Deferred`, or
`Declined` plus evidence or rationale, then resolve the thread.

Repository CI and `bot-feedback-gate` are required. `bot-presence-gate` is
disabled by default. Run `npm run pr:bot-feedback-audit` for late post-merge
feedback.
